#. type: Content of: <article><section><section><section><para>
#: English/Compare_files.xml:1711 English/Compare_images.xml:117
#: English/Configuration.xml:2635 English/Configuration.xml:2801
#: English/Configuration.xml:2920 English/Configuration.xml:3349
